    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer by HARLIANGXY, selected by KASODI for its elegant glass construction, gold detailing and practical vanity storage."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/bathroom">Bathroom</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/bathroom/harliangxy-glass-gold-cosmetic-organizer.png"
            alt="Glass and gold vanity organizer by HARLIANGXY styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BATHROOM
          </p>

          <h1>
            Glass & Gold Vanity Organizer
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            HARLIANGXY
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A vintage-inspired glass organizer designed to bring order and a
            touch of elegance to the bathroom vanity. Clear glass panels framed
            in warm gold create an airy display for everyday cosmetics,
            perfumes and brushes while keeping the countertop beautifully
            organized.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Glass · Brass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>20 × 14 × 10 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Clear · Gold</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Compartments</span>
              <strong>4</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Style</span>
              <strong>Vintage · Elegant</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Cosmetics · Brushes · Perfume</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4y0JLpK"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Bathroom storage does not have to disappear behind closed doors.
            This organizer turns everyday essentials into part of the room.
          </p>

          <p>
            The combination of transparent glass and slender gold framing feels
            lighter and more decorative than conventional cosmetic storage,
            while the stepped design keeps smaller pieces visible and easy to
            reach.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like it for displaying a carefully edited collection
            of perfume bottles, skincare, makeup brushes or jewellery on a
            vanity or bathroom countertop.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Keep it looking beautiful</h2>

        <p>
          Wipe the glass regularly with a soft, slightly damp cloth and dry
          immediately to help prevent water marks. Clean the metal frame gently
          with a dry or soft damp cloth.
        </p>

        <p>
          Avoid abrasive cleaners, rough sponges and prolonged exposure to
          standing water. For a polished vanity look, remove products
          occasionally and wipe the glass base before returning them to the
          organizer.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Warm Ceramic</h3>
            <p>
              Pair the clear glass and gold frame with soft cream ceramics to
              balance the decorative detailing with something calm and tactile.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Natural Woven Storage</h3>
            <p>
              Add a woven basket nearby to introduce warmth and natural texture
              to the vanity area.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Soft Cotton Towels</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal or pale beige cotton towels soften the glass and
              metallic details and keep the space feeling relaxed.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/ava-nord-ceramic-bathroom-set-cream.png"
                alt="Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM ACCESSORIES</span>
              <h3>Ava Nord Ceramic Bathroom Set</h3>
              <p>Ava Nord</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-botanical-jewelry-box.png"
                alt="Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Botanical Jewelry Box</h3>
              <p>Tila Home</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/new-finds/vintage-butterfly-photo-frame.png"
                alt="Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Vintage Butterfly Photo Frame</h3>
              <p>LEVI DECOR</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          HARLIANGXY · GLASS & GOLD VANITY ORGANIZER
        </p>

        <h2>
          A little order, beautifully displayed.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4y0JLpK"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>